A documentation-only commit does not require rebuild, restart or redeployment
when no runtime artifact changed.

Reports must distinguish:

- Runtime implementation baseline
- Documentation closeout HEAD
- Served bundle
- Active runtime source

Do not redeploy unchanged code just to make a documentation HEAD appear in a
runtime marker.

Every active Program Slice must maintain one Evidence Ledger inside its living
